<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-07T08:59:25.907Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 08:59:25 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen attacked a convoy in Kaduna, killing two and abducting 20, while bandits seized dozens in other raids across the state. In Nasarawa, a communal clash left one dead and a motorcycle burned, and suspected armed herders shot a 14‑year-old girl. Southern Kaduna killings prompted HURIWA to request a DSS probe into possible political sponsorship, and a suspected herbal poisoning in Benue killed four and left 14 critically ill. The military recovered a cockpit voice recorder from a crashed plane that killed 25, and troops destroyed terrorist enclaves in Borno, forcing insurgents to retreat. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOMUo1Z2VpMkpzZGNCYm5hb0VRNUxPdVZrN1I4ZzB1MUt5bURPN3lXVE0zOWJfWnQ4bFI1UlpkakxDYlhJaG9oUjZBblNvbFNRaHUxX2pFRkFsMUQ4NHNpQnBVa0U1Y1VEaWNiQm9JeXpsS2U5QkdBYm9aVWo4Yjl5OU5YTUlxOTFHSVhiVWpzdHNsdk5Vd3JtaHNNd2w5UTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNVy1XT2xIdmdvRGpYTmQtTWRKXzBvaHlka1JtbVF0R0l4bnNjVXZCdE9uRlBvOFQzcmJIcGR1ZEhiOXRtUkVIMVBHbWFSMmtmeXVTdzd5UFpIOE9meFhmY3FBQWtTMmNZWElwaUNmNTlSZ3JaSG0wdjF6OFlfYUt6X2NrRjNRaVVuWUNNNVV2M2lGNVM2U3NmZjNLQXdLY0pHU2lTcC0zdndFM2NvT0RtN3dENFZNQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQR1I0b3FDT2Y3LWxVRk8ydFlFVGcwd3Z6T1JfTXExOWdYWGU1Y0FQblhXWFlZRWxqdy1QZ0JiTlNsWExyUDE5QWpaRVJjUUhTcy1uTHdjNU9hZ0tMUTk3RFdERDhwV2lqMnFhMDJwaTlQNkhNMjJLUklEcE5vTzBBM0dXSHVUTWJxUG8wMVFLMDA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPMS15NGFTT3VhTG1PUjlUc2lKTUhPU0d1TlhYUmhNZzZfMVdWOTdsU1JqV2lZN0ZMdmNDeGs1aW11V0tKY2NZdHBTWHFXMEx0dlhZWDJUaXpFNGpwQ2pURGdsUm1jSnctX1